menu "BlueAudio Puck: identity"

    config PUCK_BT_DEVICE_NAME
        string "Bluetooth device name"
        default "BlueAudio Puck"
        help
            Shown in the phone or computer pairing list.

    config PUCK_PAIRING_WINDOW_SECONDS
        int "How long the puck stays discoverable after a long press"
        default 120
        range 30 600
        help
            Outside this window the puck is connectable but not discoverable,
            so devices it already knows can return while strangers cannot pair.
            A puck with no bonded sources stays discoverable from boot, because
            otherwise it could never be paired at all.

endmenu
